{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1460774-dante-s-ascension-blog","id":1460774,"title":"Dante's Ascension Blog?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-09-21T18:31:55-07:00","id":1460774,"title":"Dante's Ascension Blog?","content":"The kickstarter for the <i>Werewolf Apocalyptic Record </i>has started. The book will serve a function similar to that of <i>Beckett's Jyhad Diary </i>- it's going to provide an overview of the WtA metaplot, will likely visit a lot of locations, and show the werewolf state of affairs as of last Tuesday.<br /> <br /> I mention this so I can start a semi-fatuous thread about a potentially similar book for Mage the Ascension. An mostly in-character work which will provide an overview of the MtA metaplot, will visit a lot of locations, and show the Mage state of affairs as of last Tuesday.<br /> <br /> What would you want in such a book?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-21T19:15:56-07:00","id":1460780,"title":"","content":"There were some metaplot developpments in M20 that weren't very fleshed out. Like the Disparate Aliance, and a new Council in &quot;the Colony&quot;. It would be interesting to see an insider's perspective on all of that<br /> <br /> Now that you mention Dante...Mage has the Spy Demise in the DigiWeb as a mostly neutral place where the shadiest computer wizards of every faction (and some beings from outside) join to exchange intelligence and stories. If one were to explore a ton of Lore IOC, that could be a good place to start.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","name":"Aleph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3056"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-21T22:49:27-07:00","id":1460793,"title":"","content":"Dante's blog, or something of the like (or even just being kept up to date in his honour) would be a great. As Aleph said, the Spy's Demise would be a great place to also pick up what people were thinking as things changed, as the war goes hot or cold as needed etc.<br /> <br /> The only issue is that it's unlikely to be as argumentative as the Tradition Wiki in Panopticon Quest.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11535-furoan","name":"Furoan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"52"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-22T13:29:02-07:00","id":1460898,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Furoan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1460774-dante-s-ascension-blog?p=1460793#post1460793\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">...Tradition Wiki in Panopticon Quest.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not familiar with this - what is it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-23T05:10:56-07:00","id":1461006,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grumpy RPG Reviews</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1460774-dante-s-ascension-blog?p=1460898#post1460898\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm not familiar with this - what is it?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Panopticon Quest is a quest being run (slowly) on Sufficient Velocity by MJ12 Commando. For those who are not familiar with the term, a 'quest' is a creative writing project where at the end of each chapter or instalment readers will 'vote' on the next course of action from a pre-created set of choices.<br /> <br /> Panopticon Quest is a story about an NWO Agent and their construct making their way in a Technocracy that is dealing with a great deal fewer resources ten years after the week of nightmares than they had back in the 'old program days'. Tradition Wiki pops up a couple of times in supplementary information and side stories and is, as the name applies, a wiki that somebody in the Traditions has set up...and, like all wiki's, the editing page si filled with arguments, flame wars, people with wildly different views on what's going on (as expected in a Mage game).<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11535-furoan","name":"Furoan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"52"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-23T08:19:42-07:00","id":1461028,"title":"","content":"The &quot;Panopticon Quest&quot; sounds interesting.<br /> <br /> I only suggested the name &quot;Dante's Ascension Blog&quot; because it is short, punchy, and Dante's name is recognizable. But the central idea is less about Dante's than some resource to consolidate and update MtA metaplot information.<br /> <br /> Personally I hope the pogrom restarts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}